WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:23.160
(fast-forwarded voice squeaks)

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.980
Good morning, Hank. It's Thursday, January
18th.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.980
Yes!

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:33.660
If you're wondering why I'm doing my Happy
Dance, it's because I lost three pounds this

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:38.040
week! I'm only twelve pounds away from being
a light-heavyweight according to the International

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:43.610
Boxing Federation. Yes!

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:46.890
Unfortunately, I am also doing my sad dance.

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:55.989
So I may have to extend my deadline by a couple
of days which is particularly humiliating

00:00:55.989 --> 00:01:00.620
considering I shared it in public on our video
blog, but I think I will definitely be done

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:08.600
by Wednesday. Definitely by Wednesday! Definitely
by Wednesday! Definitely by Wednesday! Next

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:10.590
Friday by the very latest.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:14.100
Sometimes when I take a morning off from writing,
I like to go outside, walk through the park,

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.960
and play this game. The game is called Who's
Outside on the Upper West Side of Manhattan.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:18.960
(singing)

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:25.030
Nanny, nanny, rich kid; nanny, nanny, rich
kid; nanny, nanny, rich kid; funny dog!

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:29.049
Nanny, nanny, rich kid; nanny, nanny, rich
kid; nanny, nanny, rich kid; funny dog!

